{"id":"3cb264d80b6f4083","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-numeral-injective.md","title":"Numeral Injective","display":"thm-numeral-injective — Numeral Injective","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-numeral-injective","aliases":["92-thm-numeral-injective"],"display":"thm-numeral-injective — Numeral Injective","depends_on":["[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-g-system]]"],"source":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-numeral-injective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-numeral-injective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-numeral-injective — Numeral Injective"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{n}, \\bar{m}\">\\(\\bar{n}, \\bar{m}\\)</span> (numerals, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n, m \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(n, m \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (natural numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}injective}\\vdash\n\\forall n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl[(n=m\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\bar n=\\bar m)\n\\land(n\\neq m\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\bar n\\neq\\bar m)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}injective}\\vdash\n\\forall n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl[(n=m\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\bar n=\\bar m)\n\\land(n\\neq m\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\bar n\\neq\\bar m)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对象语言不能直接包含元语言命题<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=m\">\\(n=m\\)</span>；因此把相等与不等两种元层情形分别陈述</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>能区分不同的numeral</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\neq m\">\\(n \\neq m\\)</span>，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\vdash \\bar{n} \\neq \\bar{m}\">\\(G \\vdash \\bar{n} \\neq \\bar{m}\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是算术的基本性质</li>\n<li>numeral可区分性用于把元层自然数的相等/不等转移为相应闭项等式的可证性；它不是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性定义本身</li>\n<li>numeral不等式在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可证</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bar{n}, \\bar{m}$ (numerals, see [[92-df-numeral]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\bar{n}, \\bar{m}","display":false},{"tex":"n, m \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}injective}\\vdash\n\\forall n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl[(n=m\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\bar n=\\bar m)\n\\land(n\\neq m\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\bar n\\neq\\bar m)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"n=m","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"n \\neq m","display":false},{"tex":"G \\vdash \\bar{n} \\neq \\bar{m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1328,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-288","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-numeral-injective]]"}],"outgoing":["b78092e29a02d697","e0eabee5d77258a7"]}